<title>SOUTH AFRICA: BATECOR SELLS COMPUTER UNIT TO Q DATA.</title>
<headline>BATECOR SELLS COMPUTER UNIT TO Q DATA.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African industrial group Bateman Industrial Corp Ltd (Batecor) said on Tuesday that it had agreed to sell its Computer Alliance (pty) Ltd unit to information technology firm Q Data Ltd for 16.2 million rand.</p>
<p>The deal is to be settled by the issue of Q Data shares.</p>
<p>Batecor said it had decided to concentrate its businesses on engineering and the sold computer network unit had become a non-core operation.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
